       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. T6V2P5A.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-UPDATE-RECEIVED       PIC X VALUE 'N'.
       01  WS-REGISTRY-STATUS       PIC X(8) VALUE 'PENDING'.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       1000-MAIN.
           ACCEPT WS-UPDATE-RECEIVED
           PERFORM 2000-UPLOAD-UPDATE
           DISPLAY WS-REGISTRY-STATUS
           STOP RUN.
       2000-UPLOAD-UPDATE.
           IF WS-UPDATE-RECEIVED = 'Y'
              MOVE 'UPLOADED' TO WS-REGISTRY-STATUS
           END-IF.
